00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:23.120
<v Mike>It's not like we get, you know, Arnold Schwarzenegger's Terminator or something, right?

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:29.240
<v Joe>Yeah. I don't know. I'm not actually super familiar with like Jackie Chan's history before he was an actor, but was

00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:35.160
<v Joe>he? I mean, I'm assuming he was like actually like an athletic martial artist performing in competitions

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:36.940
<v Joe>and stuff. I'm guessing.

