00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:10.020
<v Joe>Yeah, I guess that's true.

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:14.460
<v Joe>I mean, I feel like maybe it's because I'm coming at this from like, we've seen a lot

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:20.740
<v Joe>of people on the covers or big names in games that we don't recognize because we didn't grow

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:24.840
